yen una sauna privada, un gimnasio completamente equipado, acceso mediante ascensor a todas las plantas y múltiples terrazas diseñadas para la vida al aire libre. La propiedad ofrece un equilibrio perfecto entre arquitectura moderna, confort y privacidad, siendo ideal como residencia permanente, vivienda vacacional o inversión.\n\nMonte Mayor es una de las comunidades cerradas más ‌exclusivas ‌de ‌Benahavís, ‌conocida ‌por ‌su tranquilidad, ‌belleza natural ‌y seguridad 24 horas, todo ‌ello ‌a ‌poca ‌distancia ‌de Marbella, campos de ‌golf, ‌playas ‌y ‌todo ‌tipo ‌de ‌servicios.","en":"Stunning contemporary villa located within the exclusive gated community of Monte Mayor, Benahavís, offering breathtaking panoramic views across the surrounding mountains and out to the Mediterranean Sea. Set on a generous 2,863 m² plot, this impressive property boasts a total built area of 503 m² and has been thoughtfully designed to maximise light, space, and the natural surroundings. \n \nThe villa features five spacious bedrooms and five modern bathrooms, with a sleek open-plan living area defined by floor-to-ceiling glass that seamlessly connects the interior with the expansive terraces and infinity pool. The main living space flows effortlessly into outdoor entertaining areas, creating the perfect setting for both relaxing and hosting while enjoying the incredible views.\n\nAdditional features include a private sauna, fully equipped home gym, lift access across all levels, and multiple terraces designed for outdoor living. The property offers a perfect balance of modern architecture, comfort, and privacy, making it ideal as a permanent residence, holiday home, or investment.\n\nMonte Mayor is one of the most ‌sought-after ‌gated ‌communities ‌in ‌Benahavís, ‌known for ‌its tranquility, ‌natural beauty, and 24-hour security, ‌while ‌still ‌being ‌within ‌easy reach of Marbella, ‌golf ‌courses, ‌beaches, ‌and ‌all ‌local ‌amenities."},"features":{"es":["Pueblo","Pueblo de Montaña"